<section class="about">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>
                I am a postdoctoral researcher at the <a href="https://cg3hci.dmi.unica.it/">CG3HCI Lab</a>, University of Cagliari,
                where I explore how LLMs can support end-user developers in customizing XR environments, while
                during my PhD, I developed methodologies that combine machine learning with compositional approaches to gesture recognition.
            </p>
            <p>
                As a software developer, I have worked on diverse projects ranging from sports analytics to web platforms.
                I worked as a software developer at <a href="https://www.footurelab.com/">FootureLab</a>,
                where I was primarily involved in developing algorithms and tools for football data analysis, as well as
                backend development using Django for various projects managed by <a href="https://abinsula.com/it/">Abinsula</a>.
                Between 2022 and 2023, I worked as a full-stack developer at <a href="https://webranking.it/">WebRanking</a>, where I contributed to both the
                backend and frontend of different showcase websites and an e-commerce platform. More recently, I have
                also worked as a teacher for courses organized by <a href="https://formatica.it/">Formatica</a> under the patronage of the Regione Autonoma della Sardegna.
            </p>
